---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How Much Does a Life Care Plan Cost? — MyLifeCarePlanning.com"
  description="Life care plan costs vary by complexity, provider type, and case requirements. Learn what factors affect pricing and what to expect when retaining a life care planner."
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1">
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white">
      <div class="page-container py-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold">How Much Does a Life Care Plan Cost?</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-brand-200 max-w-2xl">Pricing varies by provider type, case complexity, and scope of services required.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <div class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose prose-gray">
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">The cost of a life care plan varies significantly based on the credentials of the planner, the complexity of the injury, the number of records to review, and whether expert witness testimony is required.</p>

        <h2>Typical cost ranges</h2>
        <div class="not-prose grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6">
          {[
            { type: "Nurse LCP", range: "$3,000 – $8,000", note: "Moderate injury cases" },
            { type: "Physician LCP", range: "$8,000 – $25,000+", note: "Catastrophic injury, high-value cases" },
            { type: "Deposition / Trial", range: "$300 – $700/hr", note: "Expert witness testimony" },
          ].map(item => (
            <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-center">
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase mb-1">{item.type}</p>
              <p class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-800">{item.range}</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">{item.note}</p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

        <h2>What factors affect cost?</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Provider credentials</strong> — Physician planners typically charge more than nurse planners due to their medical degree and independent clinical authority</li>
          <li><strong>Case complexity</strong> — Multi-system trauma, TBI, and spinal cord injury cases require more records review and longer plans</li>
          <li><strong>Volume of medical records</strong> — Extensive records increase review time and cost</li>
          <li><strong>Travel requirements</strong> — In-person evaluation may add travel expenses</li>
          <li><strong>Expert witness services</strong> — Deposition and trial testimony are typically billed separately at hourly rates</li>
          <li><strong>Geographic region</strong> — Rates vary by location across the country</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Is a life care plan worth the cost?</h2>
        <p>In high-value personal injury and workers' compensation cases, a well-documented life care plan typically produces settlement or verdict outcomes that far exceed the cost of the plan itself. It serves as the backbone of future damages calculations and is often the most important document in a catastrophic injury case.</p>

        <div class="not-prose mt-10 p-6 bg-brand-50 border border-brand-200 rounded-xl text-center">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-brand-900 mb-2">Find a Physician Life Care Planner</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Connect directly with board-certified MDs and DOs in your state.</p>
          <a href="/physician-life-care-planners" class="btn-primary text-sm">Browse by State</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
